WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.260
- What's up everybody?

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:03.903
We are back with Evangeline
Lilly and Jonathan Davis.

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:04.736
Give it up!

00:00:04.736 --> 00:00:07.009
(audience applauding)

00:00:07.009 --> 00:00:09.000
Evangeline stars in the new Marvel movie

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.400
"Ant-Man and the Wasp: Quantumania"

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:15.150
Meanwhile, Jonathan and
myself are big Marvel fans.

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:18.270
So it's time to see who knows
they're superheroes best.

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:20.141
This is gonna be sad for you if you lose.

00:00:20.141 --> 00:00:21.406
- I am definitely gonna lose.

00:00:21.406 --> 00:00:23.952
- With a superhero super quiz.

00:00:23.952 --> 00:00:27.386
♪ Superhero Super Quiz ♪

00:00:27.386 --> 00:00:28.440
- Oh my God.

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:29.513
If you lose, oh man.

00:00:29.513 --> 00:00:31.567
- I am so gonna lose.

00:00:31.567 --> 00:00:32.730
- You're never gonna hear the end of it

00:00:32.730 --> 00:00:34.590
'cause we're not actually
in a Marvel movie.

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:36.734
- I'm only in one of them.

00:00:36.734 --> 00:00:37.570
- Okay.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.210
Could you give us a hand, Lord?

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:40.916
Do you hear us?

00:00:40.916 --> 00:00:42.960
(ethereal chime)

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:44.310
- [God] Why yes, I do, Kelly.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.230
You like? That's my
little theme song there.

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:47.340
That's pretty badass.

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:48.173
I like that.

00:00:48.173 --> 00:00:49.006
What's up y'all?

00:00:49.006 --> 00:00:50.700
Man, I'm so excited for
"Ant-Man and the Wasp."

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:51.533
I can't wait.

00:00:51.533 --> 00:00:52.366
I'm so excited.

00:00:52.366 --> 00:00:53.670
Wasp is my favorite.

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:55.080
You need your own movie, girl.

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:55.950
You need your own movie.

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:57.660
That's what I'm talking about.

00:00:57.660 --> 00:00:58.493
Come on, now.

00:00:59.762 --> 00:01:00.840
♪ Come on, now ♪

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:02.490
- [God] Yep, I went sub-atomic once.

00:01:02.490 --> 00:01:03.840
That's how the Big Bang happened.

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:05.100
Anyway-

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:05.933
- Nice.

00:01:05.933 --> 00:01:06.766
- [God] We're gonna play a game.

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:08.340
What we're gonna do today is pretty basic.

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:10.530
I'm gonna ask you a
question about a superhero

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:12.510
and the first person to hit that button

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:14.460
and answer will get the point.

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:17.460
And steals are allowed.

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:19.710
Now we got a Marvel prize on the line.

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:22.230
Even though my lawyers
won't let us say that word

00:01:22.230 --> 00:01:23.063
too many times.

00:01:23.063 --> 00:01:24.090
Marvel, oops, my bad.

00:01:24.090 --> 00:01:25.140
I said it again.

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:26.760
Jonathan, you playing for

00:01:26.760 --> 00:01:29.186
the people on the left
side of the audience.

00:01:29.186 --> 00:01:32.076
(audience cheering)

00:01:32.076 --> 00:01:33.180
- I got y'all

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:34.860
- Kelly, you playing for the middle?

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:36.150
Come on, make some noise middle.

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:37.624
- Woo!

00:01:37.624 --> 00:01:39.480
(audience cheering)

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:41.970
- [God] And Evangeline, you
playing for the right side.

00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:43.351
- I'm so sorry.

00:01:43.351 --> 00:01:45.767
I'm so sorry, I apologize.

00:01:45.767 --> 00:01:46.600
- Owning it.

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:47.490
- [God] Good luck to y'all.

00:01:47.490 --> 00:01:48.480
Let's get started.

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:50.010
Here's your first question.

00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:52.443
What kind of doctor was Dr. Strange?

00:01:53.610 --> 00:01:55.323
- He was a strange doctor.

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:57.810
- [God] He was a strange doctor.

00:01:57.810 --> 00:02:00.633
But unfortunately, that is incorrect.

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:03.120
What kind of doctor?

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:04.950
Steals are allowed.

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:07.075
- We both hit it.

00:02:07.075 --> 00:02:07.908
He gets it.

00:02:07.908 --> 00:02:08.910
I've gotta be the host.

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:10.703
- I'm a guest, so I get it.
- Yeah.

00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:14.349
- He was a surgeon.
- Yep.

00:02:14.349 --> 00:02:15.540
(bell dings)
- [God] He was a surgeon.

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:17.400
Jonathan's got a point.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:18.752
(audience cheering)

00:02:18.752 --> 00:02:20.088
That's what I'm talking about.

00:02:20.088 --> 00:02:20.970
Here we go.
- Okay.

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:22.710
Here's the next question.

00:02:22.710 --> 00:02:27.150
On which eye does Nick
Fury wear an eyepatch?

00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:29.208
Kelly.
- Right, right eye.

00:02:29.208 --> 00:02:30.360
(buzzer buzzes)
- [God] Ooh, I'm sorry.

00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:31.890
It's not the right

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:33.480
- I thought it was his right.

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:34.830
- That's Evangeline right there.

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:35.663
You could take it.

00:02:35.663 --> 00:02:37.490
Take it, girl.
- There's only one option.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:39.254
- [God] It's gonna be tough.

00:02:39.254 --> 00:02:41.171
- The middle one.
- Yes.

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:44.130
- The Gods of Marvel love me.

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:45.484
The left eye.

00:02:45.484 --> 00:02:47.483
(bell dinging)
- [God] It is the left eye.

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:50.610
- I dunno how you guessed that.

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:53.520
- [God] Now here's a little
bonus question for you.

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:56.580
How did Nick Fury lose his eye?

00:02:56.580 --> 00:02:57.660
- Ooh, I don't remember that.

00:02:57.660 --> 00:02:58.800
- [God] Go ahead, Jonathan.

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:01.230
- He lost it to an alien cat.

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:02.063
- [Kelly] Oh, that's right.

00:03:02.063 --> 00:03:02.896
- [God] That is true.

00:03:02.896 --> 00:03:03.993
It was Goose the cat.

00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:06.120
- Oh, that's right.

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:08.550
- [God] Goose, the cat,
took a swipe at his eye.

00:03:08.550 --> 00:03:09.480
Nice work, Jonathan.

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:10.313
Here we go.

00:03:10.313 --> 00:03:11.370
Here's your next question

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:15.123
What is the superhero
name of Natasha Romanoff?

00:03:16.522 --> 00:03:17.355
- [Jonathan] She's so fast.

00:03:17.355 --> 00:03:18.720
- Black Widow.

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:19.620
- [God] It is Black Widow.
(bell dinging)

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:20.453
You got it.

00:03:20.453 --> 00:03:21.600
That's Evangeline right there.

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:23.813
- Wait real quick.

00:03:23.813 --> 00:03:26.250
Wasn't that in "Captain Marvel"
that we saw that happen?

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:27.083
Yeah, it happened in Captain Marvel.

00:03:27.083 --> 00:03:28.830
I should get a point for
that, but whatever, it's cool.

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:31.084
- [God] We'll give you a point for that.

00:03:31.084 --> 00:03:32.720
There's a point.

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:34.303
- It was my point though.

00:03:34.303 --> 00:03:35.755
- Giving away, givin' away points.

00:03:35.755 --> 00:03:36.630
- [God] It's all right, that's what I do.

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:37.820
I'm God, I do what I want.

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:39.771
- [Jonathan] God's giving away points.

00:03:39.771 --> 00:03:40.770
- Her God.

00:03:40.770 --> 00:03:42.600
- The tribulations, I've heard.

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:44.190
- All right, here's
your next question now.

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:45.660
This is a multiple choice.

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:48.931
What is Captain America's
shield made out of?

00:03:48.931 --> 00:03:51.119
- Why did I hit my button?

00:03:51.119 --> 00:03:52.007
I don't remember.

00:03:52.007 --> 00:03:56.161
It's made outta like really hard (bleep)

00:03:56.161 --> 00:03:56.994
- You need the point.

00:03:56.994 --> 00:03:57.827
- Go ahead.

00:03:57.827 --> 00:03:58.660
No, I don't remember.

00:03:58.660 --> 00:03:59.820
Like, titanium, sure.

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:01.420
I don't know, It's some kind of-

00:04:02.261 --> 00:04:04.060
(buzzer buzzes)
- [God] It's not titanium

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:05.160
- Wakanda, Wakanda!

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:06.482
It's the thing from from Wakanda.

00:04:06.482 --> 00:04:07.620
- It is from Wakanda.
- What is it though?

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:08.453
I'll give it.

00:04:08.453 --> 00:04:09.376
What is it?

00:04:09.376 --> 00:04:11.721
- Vibranium, vibranium, vibranium.

00:04:11.721 --> 00:04:12.878
- [God] It is vibranium.
(bell dinging)

00:04:12.878 --> 00:04:14.608
- I shouldn't get that.
- You are correct.

00:04:14.608 --> 00:04:15.791
- I shouldn't get that.

00:04:15.791 --> 00:04:17.445
I shouldn't get that.

00:04:17.445 --> 00:04:20.130
because I didn't remember that.

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:20.963
- [God] You shouldn't.

00:04:20.963 --> 00:04:21.929
But I'll give it to you anyway.

00:04:21.929 --> 00:04:22.762
- We're gonna take pity on you.

00:04:22.762 --> 00:04:23.890
- We're doing pretty well.

00:04:24.785 --> 00:04:25.959
(air horn blowing)

00:04:25.959 --> 00:04:26.792
- [God] Uh-oh.

00:04:26.792 --> 00:04:30.390
That noise means it's time
for one last question.

00:04:30.390 --> 00:04:32.100
And here it is.

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:32.960
- I mean...

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:35.190
- [God] This is for all the points.

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:36.540
- Better be about the Wasp.

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:41.280
- [God] How many infinity
stones are there.

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:42.390
Kelly?

00:04:42.390 --> 00:04:44.130
- Four...

00:04:44.130 --> 00:04:45.570
Five.

00:04:45.570 --> 00:04:47.096
- [God] I'm sorry. It's not five.

00:04:47.096 --> 00:04:48.676
- It was four knuckles.

00:04:48.676 --> 00:04:50.513
(Kelly screams)

00:04:50.513 --> 00:04:51.937
- [God] Evangeline.

00:04:51.937 --> 00:04:55.876
(Evangeline laughs and claps)

00:04:55.876 --> 00:04:56.750
- There are six.

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:59.640
- [God] There are six.
(bell dings)

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:03.175
That means Evangeline is the
big winner of today's game.

00:05:03.175 --> 00:05:06.319
(kelly laughs)

00:05:06.319 --> 00:05:09.319
- I don't know a thing about Marvel.

00:05:10.397 --> 00:05:13.197
I just know that my son has
the glove with the knuckles.

00:05:15.193 --> 00:05:18.600
Everyone's a winner today except for me.

00:05:18.600 --> 00:05:21.120
That's because courtesy
of our friends at IMAX,

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:22.867
everyone is getting two tickets to see

00:05:22.867 --> 00:05:25.427
"Ant-Man and the Wasp: Quantumania."

00:05:25.427 --> 00:05:27.648
(audience cheering)

00:05:27.648 --> 00:05:31.431
And because Evangeline won,
here photo will be hung-

00:05:31.431 --> 00:05:33.864
(audience cheering)

00:05:33.864 --> 00:05:36.614
on "The Chicks Wall of Champions"

00:05:40.281 --> 00:05:41.364
I am a loser.

00:05:42.201 --> 00:05:43.034
Whoa.

00:05:43.034 --> 00:05:44.133
I know nothing.

